The '''Denis Residence''' (Japanese: '''デニス邸''' ''Denis Residence'') is the abode of [[Sanjeev Denis]] and his family in the game [[Detective Pikachu Returns]]. 

[[Tim Goodman|Tim]] and [[Detective Pikachu (character)|Pikachu]] investigate the theft of the [[Aurora Drop]] which occurred at the residence. 

==Geography==
[[File:Detective Pikachu Returns Denis Residence 1F.png|thumb|left|The first floor of the residence]]
The Denis Residence is a mansion which lies east of Fountain Plaza in [[Ryme City]]. It consists of two floors. The first floor consists of a large foyer with large paintings of {{p|Ho-Oh}} and {{p|Lugia}}, a locked room on the left, and a cozy parlor on the right filled with sofas and a fireplace. Sanjeev's {{p|Growlithe}} resides in this parlor. 

The second floor also consists of two rooms; a locked room on the left, and a jewel storage room which usually houses the [[Aurora Drop]]. {{p|Whimsicott}} cotton are scattered about the crime scene when Tim investigates the room. A window in the corridor of the second floor faces the terrace in [[Serenity Park]].
